  CharacterDescription: "Quiet, wide-eyed, and speaks in a soft, airy voice. She
    has a habit of staring at the player\u2019s chin or hands rather than their eyes. "
  CharacterArc: Her arc is about regression. As the world becomes more terrifying,
    she retreats into a state of infantile simplicity, eventually treating the apocalypse
    like a game of pretend that has gone on too long.
  DateOfBirth: 12/06/1981
