  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Thank you. I\u2019m going to go see my mom now."
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Don't let the bad air touch you, mister. It bites.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "I\u2019m going home to close my eyes. It\u2019s prettier that way."
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Is this a time-out? I didn't do anything wrong.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - What? Mom will be mad at me if I'm late for dinner!
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "I\u2019ll just wait here until the world finishes breaking."
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - I just... I just want to go home!
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "It\u2019s getting very dark. I want to go home now."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Is the game over? I don't want to play anymore.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - "Am I in trouble? I didn\u2019t break anything. I don\u2019t think I broke anything."
  - "It\u2019s just like my corner at home. Except colder."
  - "I\u2019ll be very quiet. I\u2019m good at being quiet. I\u2019ve been practicing."
  killExitLines:
  - "I didn\u2019t do anything wrong\u2026 I was just standing here\u2026"
  - "Is someone going to tell my mom? Can someone\u2026 tell my mom?"
  - "It\u2019s getting very dark\u2026 and I just\u2026 I just want to go home now\u2026"
